@title Cabinet plate: EMC Bonding layer on a painted plate (weak bond outline, legend)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# Ctrl+K "EMC view on the plate" with the Bonding layer on: the drive sits on a painted plate, so its mounting area is outlined as a weak bond (rule on stated facts, not a measurement).
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-bonding.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Indicative model"
shot plate-bonding-default
check_layout
click_text "Bonding" #1
wait 15
expect "Earth and bonding"
expect "weak or missing bond"
shot plate-bonding-on
check_layout
# The legend rolls up to show the plate under it: the bond outline and its marker.
click 234 407
wait 10
shot plate-bonding-legend-folded
check_layout
# The light look.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 10
expect "Indicative model"
shot plate-bonding-light
check_layout
